# Interim GitHub.com support for Orvi until `.ov` is accepted into
# github-linguist (see docs/linguist-submission.md). Linguist has no `.ov`
# language yet, so this override makes github.com highlight `.ov` files using
# the Markdown grammar — close enough for headings, lists, emphasis, and code
# fences, though Orvi's `[component]` / `[scope]` brackets will not be
# highlighted correctly. Remove this line once Orvi ships in Linguist.
*.ov linguist-language=Markdown
